{"title":"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_1a\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1a</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/3/6b3eb2e21a67f8b12ae0c6fc9b815e7ab085d199.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n = 0}^{\\infty}{\\cos^{2n}}\\theta = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"113\" height=\"53\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/4/13404ffc5c317889f69dbe8ca491cc4b8fc73e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{2\\theta}$\" width=\"45\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/8/f6819fd867759c26c70103f42eeef0b4865d70ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text {(A)} \\frac15 \\qquad \\text {(B)} \\frac25 \\qquad \\text {(C)} \\frac {\\sqrt5}{5}\\qquad \\text {(D)} \\frac35 \\qquad \\text {(E)}\\frac45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"336\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>This is an infinite <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometric_series\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Geometric series\">geometric series</a>, which sums to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/d/5cd41d77f15bfbcc48f2b63865e2b861290fa85a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\cos^0 \\theta}{1 - \\cos^2 \\theta} = 5 \\Longrightarrow 1 = 5 - 5\\cos^2 \\theta \\Longrightarrow \\cos^2 \\theta = \\frac{4}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"391\" height=\"39\" />. Using the formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/f/70f406203af967c7559f9b61552a4ac9872d5bf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos 2\\theta = 2\\cos^2 \\theta - 1 = 2\\left(\\frac 45\\right) - 1 = \\frac 35 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"356\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1a\">Solution 1a</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1a\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>We can more directly solve this with superficially less work. Again, applying the formula for an infinite geometric series, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/b/48b18f1eea93b46e4e819b30c7515c7981b41431.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{i=0}^{\\infty}\\cos^{2i}\\theta=\\dfrac1{1-\\cos^2\\theta}=\\dfrac1{\\sin^2\\theta}=5.\\]\" width=\"287\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/7/6574fd9dcd09193a1d199a244161f92db4cb921f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^2\\theta=\\dfrac15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/6/316c00564f5e005df6efd3d6c8897f8e875862d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(2\\theta)=1-2\\sin^2\\theta=1-\\dfrac25=\\dfrac35.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"279\" height=\"38\" /> QED. \n</p><p>~Technodoggo\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/e/12ec554fccc37c1deb6cf7079a0c91039098e697.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{n = 0}^{\\infty}{\\cos^{2n}}\\theta = \\cos^{0}\\theta + \\cos^{2}\\theta + \\cos^{4}\\theta + ... = 5\\]\" width=\"347\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>Multiply both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/c/94c5add9a5ddb86c2398bcb4622bc347f344ec37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^{2}\\theta$\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> to get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/9/9490d6446fce03624c048ad7195270634def7715.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos^{2}\\theta + \\cos^{4}\\theta + \\cos^{6}\\theta + ... = 5*\\cos^{2}\\theta\\]\" width=\"307\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting the two equations, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5eb6bf302469c6990405ea0ca6c34934a34185d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos^{0}\\theta=5-5*\\cos^{2}\\theta\\]\" width=\"168\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>After simplification, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/4/1940f4021be5ba65e4441f70416118e4e02b732a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$cos^{2}\\theta=\\frac{4}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"77\" height=\"37\" />. Using the formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/f/70f406203af967c7559f9b61552a4ac9872d5bf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos 2\\theta = 2\\cos^2 \\theta - 1 = 2\\left(\\frac 45\\right) - 1 = \\frac 35 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"356\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A\">2004 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title